      ],
      "source": "https://discoveringmontana.com/towns/orchard-homes/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Since 1906, the Orchard Homes Country Life Club has been the community’s gathering place, hosting events for more than a century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://discoveringmontana.com/towns/orchard-homes/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Orchard Homes is included in the Missoula metropolitan area, reflecting its close ties to the city.",
